==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Hidden Fates|Magikarp|15}} from the {{TCG|Hidden Fates}} expansion.
*'''Splashing Dodge''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Burning Shadows|Magikarp|32}} from {{TCG|Burning Shadows}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

